OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALegal challenge launched to
OL,4,Acouncil reorganisation
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Sussex County Council has formally
OL,7,Flaunched a legal challenge to the
OL,8,Fgovernment's plans to reorganise
OL,9,Fcouncils in East Sussex and Brighton &
OL,10,FHove.
OL,12,FCouncil leader, Reform UK's Andy
OL,13,FWoolley, said "a legal letter was
OL,14,Fissued" on Friday.
OL,16,FThe process of local government
OL,17,Freorganisation was paused in September
OL,18,Fby the Communities Secretary Angela
OL,19,FRayner following legal advice.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
