OL,3,GNEWSALegal challenge launched to
OL,4,Acouncil reorganisation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Ministry of
OL,7,FHousing, Communities and Local
OL,8,FGovernment said: "We recognise the need
OL,9,Fto provide certainty so areas have
OL,10,Fclarity over their future and will set
OL,11,Fout next steps in due course."
